### 4. Complete `CHANGELOG.md`

Save this file as `CHANGELOG.md` in the root folder to document project development and address feedback:

```markdown
# Changelog - Bright Spark Electrical Website

All notable changes, bug fixes, and development milestones are documented below.

## [2.0.0] - Part 2 Implementation
### Added
- **External Stylesheet (`css/style.css`):** Created centralized CSS stylesheet linked across all 6 HTML pages (`index.html`, `aboutus.html`, `menu.html`, `events.html`, `enquiry.html`, `contact.html`).
- **CSS Reset & Custom Properties:** Added universal box-sizing reset, CSS variables for brand color scheme (`#003366` Navy, `#ff9900` Gold), and base typography scaling (`rem`).
- **Responsive Grid & Flexbox:** Converted all inline styles into CSS Grid (`repeat(auto-fit, minmax(...))`) and Flexbox classes.
- **Interactive Pseudo-Classes:** Implemented `:hover`, `:focus`, `:active`, and `:nth-child` transformations on buttons, cards, images, and form elements.
- **Media Queries (Breakpoints):** Added responsive media query breakpoints for Desktop (>1024px), Tablet (768px - 1023px), and Mobile (<767px).
- **Navigation & Form Responsive Rules:** Created mobile menu layout and full-width mobile form inputs.

### Changed
- **Navigation Header:** Standardized navigation links across all pages (`Home`, `About Us`, `Menu`, `Events`, `Enquiry`, `Contact`).
- **Inline Style Cleanup:** Removed inline formatting attributes from HTML tags to enforce separation of concerns.

## [1.2.0] - 2026-08-12
### Added
- Integrated high-resolution industrial electrical and solar photography from Unsplash.
- Added embedded map frame pointing to Polokwane coverage region on `contact.html`.

## [1.1.0] - 2026-08-10
### Added
- Configured structured service selection fields and quote inputs on `enquiry.html`.
- Implemented company mission, history, and ECA SA accreditation details on `aboutus.html`.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-05
### Added
- Initialized repository with multi-page HTML semantic skeleton and inter-linked header navigation menu.